# 换行策略：跨平台脚本与源码强制 LF（Windows 检出 CRLF 会使 bash 脚本报  错误）
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.lock text eol=lf

# 二进制标记
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.db binary
*.zip binary
*.whl binary
